{"obsah":"<p>Another interesting festival took place in Velešín. Unfortunately, because of traffic Vlasta and Lukáš arrived late and had to battle against time to get everything done. We opened the whole event and were the opening act for the invited bands. Lots of attractions and music performances attracted a relatively large number of spectators even at the start, who came to watch our exhibition too, which we squeezed into about 25 minutes including a competition for volunteers. Thanks for the invitation – next time we'll try to arrive earlier :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIMGP9395-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIMGP9395.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250990\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIMGP9506_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIMGP9506_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250986\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIMGP9541_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2FIMGP9541_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250987\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/